 "text": "-->\nCentral Farmers Cooperative - Homepage\n-->\nHomepage\nToggle Navigation\nHome\nAbout Us\nDepartment -->\nDepartment\nAgronomy\nEnergy\nFeed\nGrain\nLocations -->\nLocations\nCanova\nDimock\nFreeman\nIrene\nLyons\nMarion\nMontrose\nMt Vernon\nSalem\nScotland\nSpringfield\nTyndall\nViborg\nCash Bids\nNews\nContact Us\nCustomer Online Tools\n-->\n\"Driving success for our customers and employees with innovation, quality products & services, delivered by our dedicated team, utilizing strategic partnerships\"\n-->\n-->\nOur Mission Statement: \"To Anticipate, Meet or Exceed our Patron's Expectations\nWhile Providing Local Profitability\".\nCentral Farmers Coop and FREMAR LLC are Hiring!\nClick for Details on our Current Openings\n|\nFall 2026 Harvest Policy\nGet More Information\n|\nStay Updated with our CFC Newsletter\nClick here to read the latest issue |\nAccess Here |\nPrevious\nNext\n-->\n-->\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\n|\nGRAIN |\nAGRONOMY |\nENERGY |\nFEED |\nADMINISTRATION |\n-->\nCash Bids\nQuotes are delayed, as of October 18, 2026, 10:57:51 AM CDT or prior.\nAll grain prices are subject to change at any time.\nCash bids are based on 10-minute delayed futures prices, unless otherwise noted.\nCash Bid Locations\nCanova |\nDimock |\nFreeman |\nLyons |\nMarion |\nMontrose |\nMt Vernon |\n|\nSalem |\nSpringfield |\nTyndall |\nViborg |\nLinks\nLocal Weather\nCheck your local Weather\n-->\nForecast\nDetailed Weather\nLatest Announcements\nHarvest Hours\n|\nMon-Fri |\nSat |\nSun |\nCanova |\n8am-4pm |\n8am-TBD |\nTBD |\nDimock |\n8am-5pm |\n10am-6pm |\nClosed |\nFreeman |\n8am-5pm |\n8am-5pm |\nClosed |\nLyons |\n8am-6pm |\n8am-6pm |\nClosed |\nMarion |\n8am-7pm |\n8am-7pm |\nClosed |\nMontrose |\n8am-5pm |\n9am-5pm |\n12pm-5pm |\nMt Vernon |\n8am-6pm |\n8am-6pm |\n12pm-5pm |\nSalem |\n8am-6pm |\n8am-7pm |\nClosed |\nViborg |\n8am-7pm |\n8am-7pm |\nClosed |\nAll hours are subject to change pending weather conditions.\n10/17/26\nIt has come to our attention that some mobile text recipients are no longer receiving hours or bids as expected. If this includes you, please text \"START\" to 605-221-1741.\n10/5/26\n10/7/26\n10/1/26\nThe Harvest 2026 Policy for Central Farmers Cooperative,\neffective September 14, 2026, can be found here .\n9/14/26\n--------------------------------\nAll Inbound Fertilizer Loads need to weigh in by 3:30 PM.\nBelow is a map of the truck route for our Viborg Grain site.\n10/15/25\nTweets by @CentralFarmers\nTweets by @CentralFarmers\nCFC on Facebook\n-->\nDriving success for our customers with quality products & services, utilizing strategic partnerships, delivered by our dedicated team.\n-->\n|\n|\n© 2026 Barchart.com, Inc. All market data is hosted and powered by Barchart .\nInformation presented is provided 'as-is' and solely for informational purposes, not for trading purposes or advice, and is delayed. No representations are made by Barchart as to its informational accuracy or completeness.\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nDo Not Sell My Personal Information\nExchange Delays\nBy using this site, you agree to the storage of cookies on your devices for enhanced navigation, site analysis, and Barchart's marketing. Data sharing with social media platforms might occur based on the privacy choices you make on those platforms. For specifics, see our our Privacy Policy .\nAccept",
